        You will be given the root cause of a bug, the commit message and the corresponding patch.
        You need to extract all code statements that lead to the bug from the patch, based on the root cause and the commit message.

        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by the incorrect handling of user access permissions for VIEW resources in the `AuthorizationHelper.java` file. The code originally allowed users with the VIEW role unrestricted access to all VIEW resources, disregarding specific RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) rules that should have limited access based on defined permissions.

        Commit message:
        AMBARI-15543. RBAC based user access to view instances are
